  "docTitle": "Tagging System (Jira / Confluence Tags) - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a tagging service shared by Jira, Confluence and Bitbucket, Atlassian's most repeated 2025-26 HLD: APIs, a tag / entity / mapping schema indexed both ways, heavy tag writes, tenant isolation, tag search and top-10 trending tags with Redis sorted sets.",
  "hero": {
