    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Tagging System (Jira / Confluence Tags)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design one tag service that every product uses: put a tag on a Jira issue, a Confluence page or a Bitbucket pull request, list everything with that tag, list the tags on anything, and show the top-10 trending tags - with an API and schema clean enough to survive an Atlassian principal engineer asking \"why?\" at every box.</p>\n      "
